+---
+title: 'Story 2.2 — Cache do Aplicativo Separado dos Dados de Negócio'
+type: 'feature'
+created: '2026-09-16'
+status: 'in-progress'
+baseline_commit: 'e0a54971e9dfc2bba90ac92456ac741164eac600'
+route: 'dispatch'
